OL,3,GNEWSADevastating fire left family with
OL,4,Aonly gerbils
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Paul Stephens looks back at the
OL,7,Fday a fire destroyed his home, he
OL,8,Fremembers the speed at which everything
OL,9,Fchanged.
OL,11,FHe was in his garden sunbathing when
OL,12,Fflames started spreading towards his
OL,13,Fhouse on Gorleston Road in Warstock,
OL,14,FBirmingham, on 13 August.
OL,16,F"I was sunbathing in the garden... I
OL,17,Fcould see the smoke... it was about
OL,18,F30b@Qodd houses away and it just took
OL,19,Fover. We were hearing people shout,
OL,20,F'Wet your fences, wet your fences'...
OL,21,Fbut there was nothing you could do,"
OL,22,FStephens said.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
