OL,3,GNEWSADevastating fire left family with
OL,4,Aonly gerbils
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat had started near a park, where
OL,7,Fovergrown grass and scrubland enabled
OL,8,Fthe fire spread, had quickly travelled
OL,9,Fthrough 35 gardens.
